        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2341] The EVCC shall contain at least one contract certificate or, in case the EVCC supports contract certificate installation via EVSE, storage space for at least one contract certificate. This certificate is necessary for PnC authorization. Refer to 7.3.2.1 for contract certificate requirements.",
